        "created_at": "2013-08-03T10:35:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Lol that's cool :D. Yeah, EPEs can be very nasty…had a game against Omnitron a few weeks ago in which be played <span class=\"bbcode-i\">both</span> EPEs <span class=\"bbcode-i\">in the same turn</span>. I was thinking \"ooh, crap\", until I saw that Tachyon had two Hypersonic Assaults in-hand. Thanks to those, we managed to destroy both EPEs before they had any chance to actually deal any damage :).</p>",
