        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-03T20:15:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I one shot Omnitron with his own Electro pulse once, &nbsp;Had TTE on Vis and Omnitron was on devices take -1 damage side.</p><p>We did it that way because the vitality card that makes all equip targets came out, then EPE came out, it was perfect. &nbsp;Before then we were getting beat on pretty hard, but that EPE tore Omnitron down from full health, then destroyed itself. &nbsp;Vis had 2 hp left I think.</p><p>It's always really cool when it works like that.</p>",
